  "detail_text": "****The NAICS code that will be used in this soliciation is 541330 Engineering Services, an error in using the wrong NAICS (541380) code is in the posted soliciation, disregard that NAICS and use 541330**** *THIS REQUIREMENT IS ONLY FOR SEAPORT MAC HOLDERS TO SUBMIT A PROPOSAL AND THE SOLICIATION NUMBER IN THIS SYSTEM HAD TO BE CHANGED TO N3904026R0003 DUE TO A GLITCH, THE ACTUAL SOLICIATION NUMBER AS YOU WILL SEE ON ALL DOCUMENTATION IS N3904026R0002* Portsmouth Naval Shipyard (PNS) has a requirement for Receipt Inspectors to support the Receipt Inspection Services within the Quality Assurance (QA) Department. Receipt Inspection provides assurance that the materials procured for use on Naval Nuclear Submarines meet the required and specified requirements before being issued.",
